00:13:00,377 --> 00:13:02,346
ls aur cd bhi same.

213
00:13:02,696 --> 00:13:04,157
mkdir same hai.

214
00:13:04,377 --> 00:13:06,368
Lekin touch nahi hota.

215
00:13:06,588 --> 00:13:08,283
Uski jagah New Item.

216
00:13:08,633 --> 00:13:11,198
Hidden files ke liye ls dash Force.

217
00:13:11,548 --> 00:13:16,087
rm dash r chalta hai, bas
PowerShell pehle confirm karta hai.

218
00:13:16,437 --> 00:13:18,582
Python ke liye python ya py.

219
00:13:18,932 --> 00:13:21,756
Aur exit code ke liye dollar LASTEXITCODE.

220
00:13:22,106 --> 00:13:27,700
Iss course ki saari videos bash commands
dikhati hain, jo Mac, Linux, aur Windows ke

221
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,765
Git Bash teeno par chalti hain.

222
00:13:29,985 --> 00:13:33,194
Jahan Windows par
kuch alag ho, mai bataungi.

223
00:13:34,494 --> 00:13:37,688
Ab kuch aadatein jo
terminal ko fast banati hain.

224
00:13:37,908 --> 00:13:41,946
Pehli: Tab key. hel likho aur
Tab dabao, poora naam aa jaayega.

225
00:13:42,166 --> 00:13:46,092
Typos kam, aur pata bhi chal
jaata hai ki file sach mein hai.

226
00:13:46,442 --> 00:13:48,333
Doosri: upar wala arrow.

227
00:13:48,553 --> 00:13:51,051
Pichli commands wapas aa jaati hain.

228
00:13:51,271 --> 00:13:54,304
Dobara type mat karo, edit karke chalao.

229
00:13:54,654 --> 00:13:56,244
Teesri: control C.

230
00:13:56,464 --> 00:14:01,734
Koi command atak jaaye ya rukti hi
na ho, toh control C usse rok deta hai.

231
00:14:01,954 --> 00:14:04,887
Yeh copy nahi hai
terminal mein, yeh stop hai.

232
00:14:05,237 --> 00:14:07,353
Chauthi: clear, ya control L.

233
00:14:07,573 --> 00:14:09,342
Screen saaf ho jaati hai.

234
00:14:09,692 --> 00:14:13,675
Aur paanchvi: kisi bhi
command ke aage dash dash help lagao.

235
00:14:13,895 --> 00:14:16,996
Command khud bata degi
ki woh kya kar sakti hai.

236
00:14:18,296 --> 00:14:19,755
Interview corner.

237
00:14:19,975 --> 00:14:23,970
Pehla question: absolute aur
relative path mein kya farak hai?

238
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:31,483
Answer: absolute path root se shuru
hota hai, aur kahin se bhi kaam karta hai.

239
00:14:31,703 --> 00:14:37,382
Relative path current folder se shuru
hota hai, isliye woh iss baat par depend karta

240
00:14:37,382 --> 00:14:39,410
hai ki command kahan se chali.

241
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:44,883
Trap: aapke code mein data dot csv
likha hai, aapki machine par chalta hai, aur

242
00:14:44,883 --> 00:14:50,002
production mein fail hota hai, kyunki
wahan program kisi aur folder se chala.

243
00:14:50,352 --> 00:14:53,595
Doosra question: exit code kya batata hai?

244
00:14:55,945 --> 00:14:58,397
Answer: command successful hui ya nahi.

245
00:14:58,617 --> 00:15:02,945
Zero matlab success, aur
baaki koi bhi number matlab failure.

246
00:15:03,165 --> 00:15:08,896
Scripts, CI pipelines, aur do
ampersand isi se decide karte hain ki aage kya

247
00:15:08,896 --> 00:15:09,500
chalega.

248
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:12,070
Trap: sirf print hua text dekhna.

249
00:15:12,290 --> 00:15:15,290
Program done print
karke bhi fail ho sakta hai.

250
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:19,453
Teesra: python three type
kiya aur command not found aaya.

251
00:15:19,673 --> 00:15:21,272
Aap kya check karoge?

252
00:15:23,622 --> 00:15:25,281
Answer: pehle spelling.

253
00:15:25,501 --> 00:15:27,919
Phir ki Python install hai ya nahi.

254
00:15:28,139 --> 00:15:32,800
Phir ki uska folder PATH mein hai
ya nahi, which aur echo dollar PATH se.

255
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:35,689
Windows par python ya py try karo.

256
00:15:35,909 --> 00:15:39,578
Trap: error padhe bina
sab kuch reinstall kar dena.

257
00:15:40,878 --> 00:15:42,135
Practice time.

258
00:15:42,355 --> 00:15:45,546
Video pause karo aur
apne terminal mein khud karo.

259
00:15:45,896 --> 00:15:51,550
Pehla: ek hi command mein projects ke
andar practice, aur uske andar notes folder

260
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:51,969
banao.

261
00:15:52,189 --> 00:15:53,893
Hint: mkdir dash p.

262
00:15:54,243 --> 00:16:00,555
Doosra: todo dot txt mein do lines
likho, phir wc dash l se sirf lines ki ginti

263
00:16:00,555 --> 00:16:01,114
dikhao.

264
00:16:01,464 --> 00:16:04,730
Teesra: hello dot py ko
parent folder se chalao.

265
00:16:04,950 --> 00:16:07,016
Kaunsa path dena padega?

266
00:16:07,366 --> 00:16:12,747
Aur scenario: ek script aapke folder
mein chalti hai, lekin teammate ke yahan fail

267
00:16:12,747 --> 00:16:13,337
hoti hai.

268
00:16:13,557 --> 00:16:15,682
Teen possible reasons socho.

269
00:16:22,982 --> 00:16:23,911
Quick check.

270
00:16:24,131 --> 00:16:28,880
Aap my first repo ke
andar ho. cd dot dot, phir pwd.

271
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:30,457
Kya print hoga?

272
00:16:36,157 --> 00:16:38,881
Slash home slash student slash projects.

273
00:16:39,101 --> 00:16:41,508
Do dots matlab ek level upar.

274
00:16:42,808 --> 00:16:44,253
Doosra question.

275
00:16:44,473 --> 00:16:50,738
Kaunsi command notes dot txt ke end mein
line jodti hai, purana content mitaye bina?

276
00:16:56,438 --> 00:16:58,351
B, do greater than signs.

277
00:16:58,571 --> 00:17:02,571
Ek greater than sign poori
file ko overwrite kar deta hai.

278
00:17:03,871 --> 00:17:04,710
Recap.

279
00:17:04,930 --> 00:17:09,295
Terminal window hai, shell andar ka
program hai jo commands chalata hai.

280
00:17:09,645 --> 00:17:15,201
pwd, ls, cd, dot dot, aur tilde
se aap kahin bhi aa ja sakte ho.

281
00:17:15,551 --> 00:17:21,355
mkdir, touch, cat, cp, mv, aur rm
se files aur folders sambhalte ho.

282
00:17:21,575 --> 00:17:25,090
Aur ek greater than
overwrite karta hai, do append.

283
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:30,622
Dot se shuru hone wali files hidden
hoti hain, ls dash a se dikhti hain.

284
00:17:30,972 --> 00:17:33,296
Exit code zero matlab success.

285
00:17:33,516 --> 00:17:37,324
Aur command not found
matlab spelling, install, ya PATH.

286
00:17:37,674 --> 00:17:43,444
Agle lesson mein hum har project ko
uska apna Python environment denge, packages

287
00:17:43,444 --> 00:17:48,782
install karenge, aur secrets ko code
se bahar rakhenge, dot env file mein.

288
00:17:50,082 --> 00:17:51,822
Lesson ek complete.

289
00:17:52,042 --> 00:17:57,113
Aapne terminal mein folders,
files, aur programs sambhalna seekh liya.

290
00:17:57,333 --> 00:17:59,364
Milte hain agle lesson mein.
